<title>JAPAN: Indonesia lowers August Minas crude to $19.49.</title>
<headline>Indonesia lowers August Minas crude to $19.49.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for August lifting was calculated at $19.49 per barrel, down 22 cents from July, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>     TYPE		 AUGUST	  JULY</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  19.68	   19.68</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	19.41	   19.36</p>
<p> Attaka		   20.21	   20.21</p>
<p> Cinta		    19.01	   19.11</p>
<p> Duri		     17.97	   18.18</p>
<p> Handil		   19.43	   19.45</p>
<p> Lalang		   19.52	   19.58</p>
<p> Widuri		   18.93	   19.05</p>
<p> Belida		   20.19	   20.25</p>
<p>     TYPE		 AUGUST	  JULY</p>
<p> Anoa		     20.61	   20.61</p>
<p> Badak		    20.21	   20.21</p>
<p> Bekapai		  20.21	   20.21</p>
<p> Bunyu		    19.19	   19.41</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     18.48	   18.70</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    19.21	   19.16</p>
<p> Walio		    19.29	   19.51</p>
